    "description": "List scoped terminal sessions available to the agent. Call this first for any task involving a live Netcatty terminal, remote server, SSH session, SFTP path, or terminal tab. Select the target by label or hostname, then pass its sessionId to terminal and SFTP tools. Call it again after the user opens, closes, or renames a session.",
